  <link:footnoteLink xlink:type="extended" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link">
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH3DE680DE74A202320024CA88CCD8C6D9" xlink:label="HH3DE680DE74A202320024CA88CCD8C6D9" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH4E7549E5D11CEA248AFE1AB8EF273C71" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
There was a total of 4813 MW of actual interchancereceived between adjacent BAAs of which 1772 MW were for station service and 3041 MW for contingency reserves. The zero value entered is because none of the MWs were to meet native load. There is no load within the metered boundaries of this BA..</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH3DE680DE74A202320024CA88CCD8C6D9" xlink:to="HH4E7549E5D11CEA248AFE1AB8EF273C71" order="1" />
  </link:footnoteLink>
